@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> CustomWorkflowSetup : User initiates workflow setup
CustomWorkflowSetup --> PreferencesAnalysis : Analyzing user preferences
PreferencesAnalysis --> WorkflowSuggestion : Suggesting workflows
WorkflowSuggestion --> TaskManagement : User starts managing tasks
TaskManagement --> [*] : User exits
TaskManagement --> TaskAddition : Add task
TaskAddition --> TaskManagement : Return
TaskManagement --> TaskEdit : Edit task
TaskEdit --> TaskManagement : Return
TaskManagement --> TaskDelete : Delete task
TaskDelete --> TaskManagement : Return
TaskManagement --> WorkflowAdjustment : Adjust workflow
WorkflowAdjustment --> TaskManagement : Return
@enduml
